  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Separable verbs",
     "texto": [
      "Many German verbs have a particle in front of them that **separates** when they are conjugated and goes **to the end** of the sentence.",
      "**aufstehen** (to get up): **Ich stehe früh auf** (I get up early).",
      "**anfangen** (to start): **Ich fange um neun Uhr an** (I start at nine).",
      "**fernsehen** (to watch TV): **Ich sehe fern** (I watch TV).",
      "In the dictionary you will find them together; in the sentence, separated."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Separable verbs",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Infinitive",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "In the sentence",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "English",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
