    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The verb stays in second place",
     "texto": [
      "If the sentence starts with a time word, the subject goes after the verb: **Dann gehe ich zur Arbeit** (then I go to work), **Abends esse ich** (in the evening I have dinner).",
      "Parts of the day: **morgens** (in the morning), **mittags** (at midday), **abends** (at dusk), **nachts** (at night).",
      "**Jeden Tag** = every day. **Früh** = early. **Spät** = late."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
